WEBVTT

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:21.370
My older brother would run back home
from school in the afternoon.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:28.160
He would dash straight to his koto
and play his favorite pieces.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:35.120
Mom would soon join him and the room
would be filled with fun sounds.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:38.700
I liked that gentle time.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.540
I really loved it.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.370
"The Tsubaki School
First Performance of the Year"

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.830
"The Tsubaki School
First Performance of the Year"
"#19 Confrontation"

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.580
"#19 Confrontation"

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:25.330
Keishi's performance really does
put adults' to shame.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:30.040
You two must be so proud
to have such an excellent heir.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.450
Oh, well, um...

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.620
Akira. Did you like your
brother's performance?

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.000
Yep! I loved it!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:45.290
Since I received a passionate encore from
my cute sister, I'll play another piece!

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.200
A song by the rock band that I'm so into
right now, with my special arrangement!

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.830
Yaaaay!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.750
I'm so exhausted! Grandma's
scolding always takes forever!

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.950
It was a great performance, though.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.120
I know, right?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.540
Yep!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:08.290
Will I be able to play like you?

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:15.750
You'll be able to play a lot
better than I can... Akira!

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.410
"First Place" "Best Performance Award"

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:23.910
"First Place" "Best Performance Award"
Keishi really is amazing! He gets first
place in every competition he's in.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:28.080
I saw your brother on TV the other day.
I wish I had a big brother like him!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.790
I'll enter a competition, too!
I'll be a genius, too!

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:39.200
I'll get first place in a competition
and shine like Keishi!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.160
"Participation Award"

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.200
Participation Award...

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.950
When Keishi gets first place...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.950
What's wrong with Akira?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.160
She's feeling down because
she didn't get first place.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.500
Akira! Let's play the koto together!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:58.450
No. I'm a failure as your sister.

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.500
Akira...

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:05.950
Keishi. How can I be first place like you?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:09.870
You know, I was practicing backflips
with my friends the other day.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.580
What?! That's dangerous!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.950
I failed many times and I
even injured myself a little...

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:18.370
...but I kept trying to do it, and I did it!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:24.160
Mom! I'll enter the next competition, too!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:27.410
I'll keep entering them until I get first place!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:31.040
Since then, I've participated
in many competitions.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:36.450
I wanted to catch up with Keishi.
I wanted to shine.

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:40.250
But what I started seeing after working hard
and becoming more skilled

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:47.120
was not me shining like my brother
but his true self and talent.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:51.450
I came to realize that he
really was a true genius.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:57.700
But still, he practiced and
worked harder than anyone.

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:03.830
So I thought, "It's okay that I'm not
a genius. I can still work hard."

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.660
Akira has been working hard lately, huh?

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.580
She finally got second place the other day!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.250
I hope she can get first place soon.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.620
It'll be fine. I'm sure she'll--

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.620
Akira! Grandma!

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.040
Keishi...

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:39.160
Then, all too suddenly and unexpectedly,
our parents were gone.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.910
"Dojima"

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:44.750
"Dojima"
What?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.870
What did you just say?

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:50.450
I said I decided to quit college
and start working!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.660
But aren't you gonna succeed
the Tsubaki School?!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.290
Forgive me, Akira.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:06:00.370
I'm quitting koto.
I'll leave the Tsubaki School to you.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.540
W-Wait a sec!

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:08.080
Why are you quitting koto?!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.540
Hey! Keishi!

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.290
Why...?

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.410
The income from the Tsubaki School alone

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.580
is nowhere near enough
to support the two of you.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.450
But Keishi is good enough to perform--

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:23.910
Things aren't easy in this industry.
It'll take a while

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:26.080
before he can start earning money.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.000
Then I'll quit high school and work!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.620
Don't be ridiculous!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:33.700
You're the only one who can
succeed the Tsubaki School now!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.080
Come to terms with that!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.160
But to think that Keishi would quit koto...!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.830
Keishi...

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.000
Keishi entrusted everything to you!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.620
Are you saying that you're
going to betray his wish?!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:52.200
What...? Why is Keishi the one quitting?

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.580
Why...?

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.370
"Mizu no Hentai"?

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:59.750
That's right. Technique, singing, expression...

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.660
It's an unsurpassed masterpiece on all counts.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:06.870
I'll have you focus on this piece
for the next two years.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:07.790
What?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:12.000
Your current ability is nowhere near Keishi's.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.660
Many of the disciples are unhappy, too.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.830
So I'll intensely retrain you from
the basics using this piece.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.290
After your ability has improved,
I'll have you get first place

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:25.290
in the competition that attracts
the most attention in the koto industry.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.120
Then no one should have any more complaints.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.540
First place...

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:35.120
Understood? Work hard...
on behalf of Keishi as well.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:40.500
On that day... my days of devotedly
facing the koto started.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.580
I worked frantically...
so that I could replace my brother...

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.910
...and so that the choice he made
wouldn't become a mistake.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:53.450
I heard that girl from Hozuki will
also be in the upcoming competition.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.290
What? Isn't she still a middle school student?

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:59.450
She is. What a conceited girl...!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:03.290
Hozuki is the parent school that
the Tsubaki School belongs to.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:07.950
The Hozuki heir was a girl
who was also called a genius.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:12.330
I've heard her performance before.
It was indeed incredible.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:18.450
Perfect... No flaws... Hard to approach...
It was a performance like that.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.910
Akira. The competition is today, right?

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:26.660
I can't get away from work today
to go see your performance.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:27.790
That's okay.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.370
A-Akira... Um...

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.160
Sorry. I have to go.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.080
If I get through today,
I'm sure something will change.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.700
I'm sure the light is waiting
for me! I'm sure...!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:46.450
Entry number 5. Akira Dojima.
"Mizu no Hentai."

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.040
She's good.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.910
--♪ In Oyamada... ♪

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:08.500
--What a player... She puts such care
into every single note she plays.
--♪ In Oyamada... ♪

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:12.080
--Both her singing and
koto technique are so pure.
--♪ In Oyamada... ♪

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.450
--Every single note is beautiful.
--♪ In Oyamada... ♪

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.290
I wonder how much she devoted herself
to playing the koto to get here...

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.620
--♪ ...in the fog... I thought... ♪

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:29.370
--It's okay that I'm not a genius.
I can still work hard.
--♪ ...in the fog... I thought... ♪

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.950
--Then someday, I will...
--♪ ...in the fog... I thought... ♪

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:37.000
--I will be able to get there, too!
--♪ ...in the fog... I thought... ♪

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:46.660
♪ ...someone was making
their way through... ♪

00:09:55.540 --> 00:10:00.080
I did it... I was able to give
my best performance ever.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.120
I did it!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.410
That performance pretty much
sealed first place for you.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.500
That's not really...

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.120
Entry number 13. Satowa Hozuki.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.080
"Yaegoromo."

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.500
The Hozuki girl...

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.410
It's amazing that she can play
"Yaegoromo" at her age.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:25.250
But it's okay. I know her performance.
Even if she's a genius...

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:37.870
A single note was all it took...

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.750
The technique and expression I had attained

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:43.200
in the two years I devoted
myself entirely to koto...

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.540
Her single note crushed them all.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.330
Wh-What's this piece?!
This isn't "Yaegoromo"!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.910
This will get her disqualified!

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:57.500
I realized then... that no
matter how hard I worked,

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:01.120
I would never be able to reach that place.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.790
The best performance award
goes to Akira Dojima.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:10.750
See! Akira! They called you.
Stop being dazed and go up already!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.950
What? That girl isn't first place?

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:17.250
You dummy. She got disqualified, remember?

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.160
Oh, that's right.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:23.830
Wait, what kind of piece did
the first-place person play again?

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.330
"Second Place"
"Outstanding Performance Award"
"Third Place"

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:27.870
"The 36th National Koto Competition
Best Performance Award"

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:32.040
Will I be able to play like you?

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.120
Disqualified?! That's BS!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:45.700
After giving that performance?!
Don't mock me!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.700
"Participation Award"
Don't insult me!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.830
I thought the light was waiting for me.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.580
But what I found there was...

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.290
"The 36th National Koto Competition
Best Performance Award"

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:20.660
"The 36th National Koto Competition
Best Performance Award"
...an even deeper darkness with no exit.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.500
A short time after the competition,

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.540
I heard that girl was excommunicated.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.160
This is a perfect opportunity.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.830
The heir of the Hozuki School is gone.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:42.040
You can take that position!

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.250
That grand master of Hozuki isn't
capable in the first place.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.910
And look at the state her daughter,
their only hope, is in.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:51.790
The school is just an empty shell now.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.660
Yeah...

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.250
What's with her?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.450
I wonder why she doesn't get it...

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:05.370
Ever since Keishi left, the Tsubaki School
has been the empty shell.

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:11.200
How have I been playing the koto
up until now? How have I been facing it?

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.830
When talented people are rapidly
moving away from koto...

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:19.370
...why is someone like me still hanging onto it?

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:24.040
It hurts... It hurts... I'm exhausted.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.790
I don't care anymore.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:33.950
I joined the koto club at my high school.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.450
Please...

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:38.540
What? A school club?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:43.000
Talent, a big house, an outstanding future...
She threw everything away.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.540
What's her problem?

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:48.830
How far will she go to insult
someone who's serious about--

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:55.040
I just wanted to know what it was

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.330
that you wanted so badly
that you threw everything away

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:01.750
and even messed things up
for those around you.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:05.200
I want to know its value.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.910
That's all.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:13.160
Just kidding. I'm sorry.
I carried the joke too far.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.830
Please forget it.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.330
The value...

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.160
Just a single note...

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.290
That's all it takes.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:35.000
You don't need to hear it.
You don't need to know.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.790
You no longer need the light...

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:41.000
...because you're not capable
of handling it anyway.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.620
Well then, I'll start with the 17-string part.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.040
Start from the beginning.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.000
That's not good at all.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.200
The sound isn't clear. One more time.

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:09.910
This boy is very quick to learn.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:13.790
He absorbs what I teach
as fast as I can teach him.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:16.660
This boy is a typical hard-working type.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:21.410
I think he's got good intuition,
but he's almost pitifully...

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.000
...ordinary.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:31.870
Mr. Takinami is cruel to have
these two play the same part.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.290
Well then, next is the second koto part.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.330
Okay.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.080
Stop there.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.160
You're not putting the right
pressure on the string.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.870
Press harder.

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:52.790
Harder. That's only raising
the note by a half step.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:56.750
But I can't do it any harder than this.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:02.370
Your arm is open and shoulder is raised.
You can't press hard like that.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:07.370
Try not to press with just your arm.
Put your weight on it.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:11.540
Close my arm and put my weight on it.
Don't raise my shoulder.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.700
Good. Let's move on.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.870
"Nishina Instruments"

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:24.040
Argh! Dammit! Since that woman
told me about this unclear sound,

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.330
I can't stop thinking about it!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.750
What?

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.160
Wh-Wh-What're you doing all of a sudden?!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:38.790
Well, I was trying to remember
how hard your fingertips were.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.830
Even so, don't touch me
so casually, stupid! Perv!

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.080
Per--?!

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.660
Could she still be holding a grudge?

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.040
Hey, you're fine.

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:52.870
What?

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:55.790
You've been kinda quiet today.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.620
I just had a sore throat, that's all.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.040
Throat...

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:03.750
Here.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:11.160
You really do like strawberries, huh?

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.450
Shut up. Got a problem with that?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.910
Thanks.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.000
Missy.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:24.910
A koto teacher I know had
that DVD you were asking about.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.580
Really?!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.000
Thank you very much!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.910
Hm? What's that?

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:33.410
Miss Dojima's performance in that
competition where she got first place.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:38.830
I felt... that I should listen to it.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.120
I'll listen to it, too!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.330
Hey, let's listen to it together.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.370
Wow... I'm kinda nervous.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.290
I'm gonna play it now, okay?

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:59.000
Entry number 5. Akira Dojima.
"Mizu no Hentai."

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.120
Is something wrong, Satowa?

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:21.540
I listened to your
"Mizu no Hentai" performance.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.330
I'm sorry!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.410
What...?

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:34.290
At first, I thought you might
be up to something.

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:40.000
But after listening to your performance,
I felt very ashamed for thinking that.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:45.540
I've never heard a performance so sincere
towards a piece and the koto.

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.950
To someone who gives
a performance like that, I was--

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.370
Please stop it.

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.580
Satowa. Please raise your head.

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:57.910
Please don't make me feel any
more miserable than I do now.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.080
U-Um...!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.040
That time... why did you do it?

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.000
What?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.830
You were good enough to win first place.
Did you play a different piece

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:13.910
to purposely get disqualified
in order to stand out?

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:18.250
--It's not like--
--After that competition,
you don't know how many times I heard...

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:22.910
"Poor thing. Her performance was first place,
but the disqualified one was better."

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:25.370
"Poor thing," they said.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:29.790
I don't wanna hear a compliment
from you after all this time.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:39.620
I wanted... to get my mother back.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:44.620
Sh-She was under all sorts
of pressure and changed rapidly.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:51.250
At that time, I was invisible to her.
My words didn't reach her, either.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:59.750
So... I threw a tantrum on that big stage
screaming, "Look at me, Mom!"...

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.200
...like a small child...

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:11.830
But in the end, all I did was
hurt her and mess up the school.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:15.040
You said I wouldn't need any lessons,

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:19.290
but there are a lot of things
that I'd like to learn from you.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:24.080
So I came to formally
ask you for your guidance.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.700
The truth is, I knew it even before she told me.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:33.000
<i>That </i>performance was not a game
or her having fun. I knew that much.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:39.160
Ahh, that's right. She's only
a first-year student in high school.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:42.370
She's about the same age as me
when I could do nothing

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.790
but be protected by Keishi.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.790
Oh, her long-sought-after first place
has been totally eclipsed.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:04.250
Even though she spent two whole years...

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.290
She'll never be able to surpass her brother.

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.040
Poor thing...

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:13.330
Where're you going?
Do you want to escape from here?

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:19.330
Even if there's an exit in this darkness,
all that lies beyond it is...

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:24.040
...an endless series of walls
that you could never overcome.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.830
Um...

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:36.200
I studied "Mizu no Hentai" for two years.

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:41.540
But those two years were instantly
crushed by one single note of yours.

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:48.200
What are you saying I should teach you?

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.620
It's time... I put an end
to all my struggling.

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:29.500
Oh, Miss Dojima.

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:32.290
I'm sorry to tell you this so suddenly...

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:34.370
"Koto Club"

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:39.040
"Koto Club"
I'm going to quit teaching
your koto club as of today.

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.250
Next time, "Another Chance."

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:54.540
"#20   Another Chance"
